lle/Junior Fifth Rank|qq=}} {{ill|Senior Sixth Rank|ja|正六位|1=Senior Sixth Rank|qq=draft|qq=draft|12=simple|13=User:Immanuelle/Senior Sixth Rank|13=User:Immanuelle/Senior Sixth Rank|qq=}} {{ill|Junior Sixth Rank|ja|従六位|1=Junior Sixth Rank|qq=draft|qq=draft|12=simple|13=User:Immanuelle/Junior Sixth Rank|13=User:Immanuelle/Junior Sixth Rank|qq=}} {{ill|Senior Seventh Rank|ja|正七位|1=Senior Seventh Rank|qq=draft|qq=draft|12=simple|13=User:Immanuelle/Senior Seventh Rank|13=User:Immanuelle/Senior Seventh Rank|qq=}} {{ill|Junior Seventh Rank|ja|従七位|1=Junior Seventh Rank|qq=draft|qq=draft|12=simple|13=User:Immanuelle/Junior Seventh Rank|13=User:Immanuelle/Junior Seventh Rank|qq=}} {{ill|Senior Eighth Rank|ja|正八位|1=Senior Eighth Rank|qq=draft|qq=draft|12=simple|13=User:Immanuelle/Senior Eighth Rank|13=User:Immanuelle/Senior Eighth Rank|qq=}} {{ill|Junior Eighth Rank|ja|従八位|1=Junior Eighth Rank|qq=draft|qq=draft|12=simple|13=User:Immanuelle/Junior Eighth Rank|13=User:Immanuelle/Junior Eighth Rank|qq=}} {{ill|Senior Ninth Rank|ja|正九位|1=Senior Ninth Rank|qq=draft|qq=draft|12=simple|13=User:Immanuelle/Senior Ninth Rank|13=User:Immanuelle/Senior Ninth Rank|qq=}} {{ill|Junior Ninth Rank|ja|従九位|1=Junior Ninth Rank|qq=draft|qq=draft|12=simple|13=User:Immanuelle/Junior Ninth Rank|13=User:Immanuelle/Junior Ninth Rank|qq=}} {{ill|Greater Initial Rank|ja|大初位|1=Greater Initial Rank|qq=draft|qq=draft|12=simple|13=User:Immanuelle/Greater Initial Rank|13=User:Immanuelle/Greater Initial Rank|qq=}} {{ill|Lesser Initial Rank|ja|少初位|1=Lesser Initial Rank|qq=draft|qq=draft|12=simple|13=User:Immanuelle/Lesser Initial Rank|13=User:Immanuelle/Lesser Initial Rank|qq=}} endRanklist--><!--Senior Fifth Rank--><!--Senior Fifth Rank--><!--Senior Fifth Rank--><!--Senior Fifth Rank--><!--Senior Fifth Rank--><!--Senior Fifth Rank--><!--Senior Fifth Rank-->

{{出典の明記|date=2015th year 8月}}
'''Shōgoi''' (正五位) is one of the Ranks in the {{ill|Japanese|ja|日本|qq=draft|qq=draft|12=simple|13=User:Immanuelle/Japanese|qq=}} {{ill|Ritsuryō system|ja|律令制|qq=draft|qq=draft|12=simple|13=User:Immanuelle/Ritsuryō system|qq=}} and [[Shinkai (divine rank)|Shinkai (divine Ranks)]]. It is positioned below {{ill|Junior Fourth Rank|ja|従四位|1=Junior Fourth Rank|qq=draft|qq=draft|12=simple|13=User:Immanuelle/Junior Fourth Rank|13=User:Immanuelle/Junior Fourth Rank|qq=}} and above {{ill|Junior Fifth Rank|ja|従五位|1=Junior Fifth Rank|qq=draft|qq=draft|12=simple|13=User:Immanuelle/Junior Fifth Rank|13=User:Immanuelle/Junior Fifth Rank|qq=}}.<ref>https://www.wakapoetry.net/background/society/court-offices-titles-and-Ranks/court-Ranks/</ref> Posthumous Ranks for this level are referred to as ''Zōshōgoi''.

== Overview ==

Shōgoi, under the {{ill|Ritsuryō system|ja|律令制|qq=draft|qq=draft|12=simple|13=User:Immanuelle/Ritsuryō system|qq=}}, was divided into upper and lower grades. In terms of {{ill|official Ranks|ja|官位|1=Kan'i system|qq=draft|qq=draft|12=simple|13=User:Immanuelle/official Ranks|13=User:Immanuelle/Kan'i system|qq=}}, it corresponded primarily to {{ill|Kyōkan|ja|京官|qq=draft|qq=draft|12=simple|13=User:Immanuelle/Kyōkan|qq=}} (capitals officers), especially positions such as {{ill|Benkan|ja|弁官|1=Benkan (administrator)|lt=Benkan|qq=draft|qq=draft|12=simple|13=User:Immanuelle/Benkan|qq=}} ({{ill|Chūben|ja|左右中弁|qq=draft|qq=draft|12=simple|13=User:Immanuelle/Chūben|qq=}} or {{ill|Shōben|ja|少弁|qq=draft|qq=draft|12=simple|13=User:Immanuelle/Shōben|qq=}}) of the {{ill|Daijō-kan|ja|太政官|1=Daijō-kan|qq=draft|qq=draft|12=simple|13=User:Immanuelle/Daijō-kan|13=User:Immanuelle/Daijō-kan|qq=}}, {{ill|Daibu|ja|大輔|qq=draft|qq=draft|12=simple|13=User:Immanuelle/Daibu|qq=}} of the {{ill|Eight Ministries|ja|八省|qq=draft|qq=draft|12=simple|13=User:Immanuelle/Eight Ministries|qq=}}, {{ill|Ōbanshi|ja|大判事|qq=draft|qq=draft|12=simple|13=User:Immanuelle/Ōbanshi|qq=}}, {{ill|Ōzen-shoku|ja|大膳職|qq=draft|qq=draft|12=simple|13=User:Immanuelle/Ōzen-shoku|qq=}} (Ōzen-daibu), {{ill|Shōshō|ja|少将|qq=draft|qq=draft|12=simple|13=User:Immanuelle/Shōshō|qq=}} of the {{ill|Konoe Guards|ja|近衛府|qq=draft|qq=draft|12=simple|13=User:Immanuelle/Konoe Guards|qq=}}, and {{ill|Ōkan|ja|衛門府|qq=draft|qq=draft|12=simple|13=User:Immanuelle/Ōkan|qq=}}. These positions marked the middle-tier bureaucratic status.

In the {{ill|samurai|ja|武家|qq=draft|qq=draft|12=simple|13=User:Immanuelle/samurai|qq=}} class, the {{ill|Hōjō clan|ja|北条氏|qq=draft|qq=draft|12=simple|13=User:Immanuelle/Hōjō clan|qq=}} received this Rank during the {{ill|Kamakura period|ja|鎌倉時代|qq=draft|qq=draft|12=simple|13=User:Immanuelle/Kamakura period|qq=}}, while it was granted to {{ill|daimyō|ja|大名|qq=draft|qq=draft|12=simple|13=User:Immanuelle/daimyō|qq=}} during the {{ill|Toyotomi regime|ja|豊臣氏|qq=draft|qq=draft|12=simple|13=User:Immanuelle/Toyotomi regime|qq=}}. However, during the {{ill|Edo period|ja|江戸時代|qq=draft|qq=draft|12=simple|13=User:Immanuelle/Edo period|qq=}}, appointments to Shōgoi decreased as focus shifted to {{ill|Jūshi'i|ja|従四位|1=Junior Fourth Rank|qq=draft|qq=draft|12=simple|13=User:Immanuelle/Jūshi'i|13=User:Immanuelle/Junior Fourth Rank|qq=}} and {{ill|Jūgoi|ja|従五位|1=Junior Fifth Rank|qq=draft|qq=draft|12=simple|13=User:Immanuelle/Jūgoi|13=User:Immanuelle/Junior Fifth Rank|qq=}}. In this era, the Rank was mainly awarded to {{ill|court officials|ja|宮廷|qq=draft|qq=draft|12=simple|13=User:Immanuelle/court officials|qq=}} like {{ill|Chikashōnin|ja|地下官人|qq=draft|qq=draft|12=simple|13=User:Immanuelle/Chikashōnin|qq=}} serving the {{ill|Imperial court|ja|朝廷|qq=draft|qq=draft|12=simple|13=User:Immanuelle/Imperial court|qq=}}, {{ill|Shinnōke|ja|親王家|qq=draft|qq=draft|12=simple|13=User:Immanuelle/Shinnōke|qq=}}, {{ill|Gosekke|ja|五摂家|qq=draft|qq=draft|12=simple|13=User:Immanuelle/Gosekke|qq=}}, and {{ill|Seiga families|ja|清華家|1=Seiga families|2=ja|3=清華家|qq=draft|qq=draft|12=simple|13=User:Immanuelle/Seiga families|qq=}}.

From the {{ill|Meiji period|ja|明治|1=Meiji era|qq=draft|qq=draft|12=simple|13=User:Immanuelle/Meiji period|13=User:Immanuelle/Meiji era|qq=}}, with the enactment of the {{ill|Rank Grant Ordinance|ja|叙位条例|qq=draft|qq=draft|12=simple|13=User:Immanuelle/Rank Grant Ordinance|qq=}}, Ranks above {{ill|Jūshi'i|ja|従四位|1=Junior Fourth Rank|qq=draft|qq=draft|12=simple|13=User:Immanuelle/Jūshi'i|13=User:Immanuelle/Junior Fourth Rank|qq=}} were granted by imperial decree, while Shōgoi and below were conferred by submission (奏授). This Rank often recognized mid-level samurai, {{ill|military officers|ja|軍人|qq=draft|qq=draft|12=simple|13=User:Immanuelle/military officers|qq=}}, and {{ill|bureaucrats|ja|官僚|qq=draft|qq=draft|12=simple|13=User:Immanuelle/bureaucrats|qq=}}, especially those with notable contributions during the {{ill|Meiji Restoration|ja|明治維新|qq=draft|qq=draft|12=simple|13=User:Immanuelle/Meiji Restoration|qq=}}. Historical figures awarded the posthumous Shōgoi include {{ill|Mamiya Rinzō|ja|間宮林蔵|qq=draft|qq=draft|12=simple|13=User:Immanuelle/Mamiya Rinzō|qq=}} (granted in {{ill|1904|ja|1904年|qq=draft|qq=draft|12=simple|13=User:Immanuelle/1904|qq=}}) and {{ill|Hōjō Sanetoki|ja|北条実時|qq=draft|qq=draft|12=simple|13=User:Immanuelle/Hōjō Sanetoki|qq=}} (granted in {{ill|1915|ja|1915年|qq=draft|qq=draft|12=simple|13=User:Immanuelle/1915|qq=}}) for cultural accomplishments like founding the {{ill|Kanazawa Library|ja|金沢文庫|qq=draft|qq=draft|12=simple|13=User:Immanuelle/Kanazawa Library|qq=}}.

Under the current system, Ranks are conferred posthumously as honors. Recipients often include distinguished {{ill|university|ja|大学|qq=draft|qq=draft|12=simple|13=User:Immanuelle/university|qq=}} and {{ill|college|ja|短期大学|qq=draft|qq=draft|12=simple|13=User:Immanuelle/college|qq=}} professors, {{ill|business leaders|ja|経営者|qq=draft|qq=draft|12=simple|13=User:Immanuelle/business leaders|qq=}}, {{ill|civil servants|ja|公務員|qq=draft|qq=draft|12=simple|13=User:Immanuelle/civil servants|qq=}}, and notable {{ill|scholars|ja|学者|qq=draft|qq=draft|12=simple|13=User:Immanuelle/scholars|qq=}}, {{ill|artists|ja|芸術家|qq=draft|qq=draft|12=simple|13=User:Immanuelle/artists|qq=}}, and {{ill|performers|ja|芸能人|qq=draft|qq=draft|12=simple|13=User:Immanuelle/performers|qq=}} who received awards like the {{ill|Order of the Rising Sun, Gold Rays with Neck Ribbon|ja|旭日中綬章|qq=draft|qq=draft|12=simple|13=User:Immanuelle/Order of the Rising Sun, Gold Rays with Neck Ribbon|qq=}}.

